<title>GERMANY: TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FINAL RESULT.</title>
<headline>TENNIS-GERMAN OPEN FINAL RESULT.</headline>
<dateline>HAMBURG 1997-05-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Result in the final of the German</p>
<p>Open men's tennis tournament on Sunday (prefix number denotes</p>
<p>seeding):</p>
<p>Andrei Medvedev (Ukraine) beat 10-Felix Mantilla (Spain) 6-0</p>
<p>6-4</p>
<p>6-2</p>
</text>
